@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Kontrollera serverinstansen
GET {{baseUrl}}/instance


### 2. Hämta alla bokningar
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings


### 3. Skapa en ny bokning
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Linda Stark",
  "email": "stark@example.com",
  "dateTime": "2026-11-10T18:00:00",
  "numberOfPeople": 1,
  "status": "PENDING",
  "activity": "Spinning"
}


### 4. Hämta en specifik bokning
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/2


### 5. Uppdatera en bokning
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara Andersson",
  "email": "sara@example.com",
  "dateTime": "2026-11-10T19:00:00",
  "numberOfPeople": 2,
  "status": "CONFIRMED",
  "activity": "Yoga"
}


### 6. Ta bort en bokning
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/2